<body>
    
        <div id="japongeo-contenaire1">

            <div id="japongeo1">
                <br>
                <a href="/images/cartes/japon/honshu/tohoku/carte-global-tohoku3.webp" target="_blank">
                    <img src="/images/cartes/japon/honshu/tohoku/carte-global-tohoku3.webp" alt="Carte Tōhoku">
                </a>

            </div>

            <div id="japongeo2">

                <p>
                    <h2 class="japongeoh2">Le Tōhoku 東北地方</h2> <br>
 
                    Les kanjis de <span class="vocab_span_bold">Tōhoku 東北地方</span> signifie région du nord-est du Japon.<br><br>
                    
                    La superficie du <span class="vocab_span_bold">Tōhoku 東北地方</span> est de <span class="vocab_span_bold">67 000 km²</span><br><br>
                    
                    En 2026, sa population est estimée à environ <span class="vocab_span_bold">8,3 millions</span> d’habitants. <br><br>
                                                             
                </p>

                <p style="text-indent: 1.0em;">
                    La région du <span class="vocab_span_bold">Tōhoku</span> est divisée en 6 départements.<br><br>

                    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex: 1 1 auto; gap: 20px; font-size: 1.0em; font-weight: 300px;">

                        <span class="geo_nu">Aomori</span>  <span class="geo_nu">Iwate</span>   <span class="geo_nu">Miyagi</span> 
                        <span class="geo_nu">Fukushima</span>  <span class="geo_nu">Yamagata</span> <span class="geo_nu">Akita</span>

                    </div>	
                    <br><br>
                </p>
                <p style="text-indent: 1.0em;">

                   Les villes principales de la région du <span class="vocab_span_bold">Tōhoku</span> sont :<br><br>

                    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex: 1 1 auto; gap: 20px;">

                        <span class="geo_nu">Sendai</span> <span class="geo_nu">Fukushima</span> <span class="geo_nu">Aomori</span>  
                        <span class="geo_nu">Akita</span> <span class="geo_nu">Morioka</span> <span class="geo_nu">Yamagata</span>

                    </div>
                
                </p>
            
            </div>

        </div>

